From bb159063403f5452086355fe7fcca095fe2cf3bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaeliGlow <caeliglow@mockifylab.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:34:57 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] caeliglow: add a CaeliGlow section to Settings with motion
 and behavior controls

The sidebar gains a CaeliGlow section (sparkles glyph) wired to the
[caeliglow] schema: motion language, open duration and elasticity
sliders (bounds shared with the parser via ranges.h), hover-to-open,
and a new power_edge setting that docks the session pill to the left
or right screen edge. About now reads "About" so the brand section
owns the CaeliGlow name.
---
 assets/translations/en.json                 | 37 ++++++++++++++++-
 src/config/config_types.h                   |  8 ++++
 src/config/schema/config_schema.cpp         |  5 ++-
 src/config/schema/ranges.h                  |  3 ++
 src/shell/session/caeliglow_power_panel.cpp |  8 ++++
 src/shell/session/caeliglow_power_panel.h   |  8 ++--
 src/shell/settings/settings_registry.cpp    | 46 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/shell/settings/settings_registry.h      |  1 +
 8 files changed, 108 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/assets/translations/en.json b/assets/translations/en.json
index 103bf6527..aa41d34b1 100644
